INSERT INTO `about_pages` VALUES (1,'bkexptnn4pfd4lmbmvlebgyl','About Us','[\"About us\"]','OUR STORY','A foundation built on values, curiosity and care.','[\"Kids\' Foundation was established out of the ideology that children must be given an environment that makes them want to come to school every day, providing an atmosphere where learning becomes a joyful experience and offers a platform that let them discover their innate potential, at their own pace. At Kids\' Foundation we provide a learning environment that inspires and motivates each child, and encourage them to explore limitless possibilities in their quest for knowledge.\", \"A co-educational school catering to holistic education for students of Pre-nursery to tenth standard in English medium, is authorized to offer CBSE program from Central Board of Secondary Education, New Delhi, India.\"]','Aerial view of Kids\' Foundation circular modern school campus','[\"Spread over more than 2 acres of sprawling campus, the school is located at the heart of the town on Airport Road just a stone\'s throwaway from the International Airport. State-of-the-art infrastructure, value based education and the presence of our centuries old cultural ethos with the right blend of modernity, are the hallmarks of the institution.\", \"It is our promise to provide holistic development and learning opportunities in a lively environment, judiciously balancing academic excellence with Co-curricular proficiency. The school is supported by dedicated trained teachers who are always ready to channelize their energy and resources toward child-centered qualitative learning. Students are encouraged to develop skills that enable them to discover, authenticate and communicate concepts with clarity, accuracy and confidence. We challenge each student to reach their full potential as an enquires, knowledge seekers, critical thinkers, risk takers, and communicators, and to be principled, open-minded, caring, balanced and reflective in all that they do.\", \"The education system, besides providing an all-round education intellectually, socially, emotionally and physically, also offers guidance in critical thinking, social openness and in purposeful research. The school joins with parents and community to assist the students in acquiring knowledge and developing skills to become independent self-sufficient adults who will succeed and contribute responsibility in a global community.\"]','FOUNDER\'S MESSAGE','A Word from Our Founder','Welcome to Kids\' Foundation School, Imphal.','[\"At Kids\' Foundation, we believe education is about developing the whole child — nurturing curiosity, confidence, creativity, and the cognitive, social, physical, emotional, and aesthetic growth of every young learner.\", \"The world is changing faster than ever, and our mission is to prepare children not merely for examinations, but for life. Through quality teaching, hands-on experiential learning, and a supportive, values-grounded environment, we nurture confident learners who are ready to adapt, excel, and contribute meaningfully to society.\", \"We encourage every learner to pursue academic excellence, cultivate a lifelong love for discovery, and step into the world with integrity and empathy.\"]','“Education is not merely the study of textbooks — it is the cultivation of curiosity, character, integrity, and joyful lifelong learning.”','I warmly invite you to join our institution and become part of a community dedicated to academic distinction, holistic character, and the pursuit of excellence.','Wahengbam Brajabidhu','Founder & Chairman','Kids\' Foundation School,\nImphal, Manipur','2026-10-28 11:57:04.983000','2026-10-29 13:21:48.963000','2026-10-29 13:21:48.912000',NULL,1,NULL);
